1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,426
Welcome to Healix, a neighbourhood health marketplace demo.

2
00:00:04,426 --> 00:00:10,416
This guided tour covers the customer experience and all three partner

3
00:00:10,416 --> 00:00:13,248
roles: pharmacy, supplier, and administrator.

4
00:00:13,248 --> 00:00:19,467
The home screen introduces the service, local pharmacy comparison, wellness categories,

5
00:00:19,467 --> 00:00:23,516
popular sample products, and a reminder shortcut.

6
00:00:23,516 --> 00:00:28,112
The header includes location, basket, and account access.

7
00:00:28,112 --> 00:00:32,160
Prices throughout the demo use Indian rupees.

8
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:36,402
Search by medicine name, brand, ingredient, or category.

9
00:00:36,402 --> 00:00:41,647
Suggestions appear as you type, and keyboard navigation is supported.

10
00:00:41,647 --> 00:00:47,388
The catalogue can be filtered by category or sorted by price.

11
00:00:47,388 --> 00:00:52,632
Product artwork is illustrative unless a partner uploads a photo.

12
00:00:52,632 --> 00:00:57,239
Open Compare to review sample pharmacy prices and distances.

13
00:00:57,239 --> 00:01:02,813
A matching ingredient and strength may show a lower-priced catalogue alternative,

14
00:01:02,813 --> 00:01:07,905
but this is not medical advice or a substitution recommendation.

15
00:01:07,905 --> 00:01:12,024
Prescription items are clearly marked for pharmacist review.

16
00:01:12,024 --> 00:01:17,927
Choose Create account, then enter a name, username, Indian mobile number,

17
00:01:17,927 --> 00:01:20,718
email, and a demo password.

18
00:01:20,718 --> 00:01:24,560
Select Customer, Pharmacy vendor, Supplier, or Admin.

19
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:30,463
Vendors and suppliers add business and licence references for the simulated

20
00:01:30,463 --> 00:01:31,632
approval queue.

21
00:01:31,632 --> 00:01:35,533
After sign-in, My account displays the profile.

22
00:01:35,533 --> 00:01:41,525
Customers can update their username, name, email, mobile, delivery address, and

23
00:01:41,525 --> 00:01:42,712
profile photo.

24
00:01:42,712 --> 00:01:48,704
These details stay in this browser only; the demo does not

25
00:01:48,704 --> 00:01:50,448
provide secure authentication.

26
00:01:50,448 --> 00:01:56,240
Add an available non-prescription item to the basket, change quantities, and

27
00:01:56,240 --> 00:02:02,033
review the sample subtotal, GST, delivery charge, and total in rupees.

28
00:02:02,033 --> 00:02:05,290
Checkout creates a demo invoice only.

29
00:02:05,290 --> 00:02:11,082
UPI, card, banking, and delivery options are mock selections, and no

30
00:02:11,082 --> 00:02:12,768
payment is collected.

31
00:02:12,768 --> 00:02:18,048
My orders shows the demo order, pharmacy, items, total, status, and

32
00:02:18,048 --> 00:02:21,950
progress from order placed through preparation and delivery.

33
00:02:21,950 --> 00:02:25,852
A vendor can advance the sample order status.

34
00:02:25,852 --> 00:02:30,216
This is not a real order or delivery service.

35
00:02:30,216 --> 00:02:35,363
The prescription page lets a customer choose an image or PDF.

36
00:02:35,363 --> 00:02:40,511
The demo retains only the file name and a sample review

37
00:02:40,511 --> 00:02:45,658
status; it does not upload, store, read, or verify the prescription.

38
00:02:45,658 --> 00:02:48,552
Prescription medicines cannot be checked out.

39
00:02:48,552 --> 00:02:53,788
Create a reminder with a medicine name, morning, afternoon, or night,

40
00:02:53,788 --> 00:02:56,263
a time, and optional notes.

41
00:02:56,263 --> 00:03:00,132
Mark a reminder complete in the daily plan.

42
00:03:00,132 --> 00:03:05,367
Reminders are saved locally and do not send push notifications or

43
00:03:05,367 --> 00:03:05,904
alarms.

44
00:03:05,904 --> 00:03:11,355
The support page provides a simple order and availability chat interface.

45
00:03:11,355 --> 00:03:16,806
Replies are simulated in the browser; there is no live care

46
00:03:16,806 --> 00:03:17,365
agent.

47
00:03:17,365 --> 00:03:22,344
For health questions, contact a qualified local pharmacist or clinician.

48
00:03:22,344 --> 00:03:28,054
A pharmacy owner registers as Pharmacy vendor and supplies demo business

49
00:03:28,054 --> 00:03:29,716
and licence references.

50
00:03:29,716 --> 00:03:33,935
The account appears in the admin approval queue.

51
00:03:33,935 --> 00:03:39,645
The portal demonstrates inventory, stock alerts, incoming orders, and a prescription

52
00:03:39,645 --> 00:03:40,776
review desk.

53
00:03:40,776 --> 00:03:44,159
To enter shop inventory, choose Add medicine.

54
00:03:44,159 --> 00:03:49,356
Enter the medicine name, category, sale type, stock units received, rupee

55
00:03:49,356 --> 00:03:53,651
listing price, batch or lot number, and expiry month.

56
00:03:53,651 --> 00:03:58,849
You can optionally add a JPG, PNG, or WebP medicine photo;

57
00:03:58,849 --> 00:04:03,144
it is resized and stored in this browser demo.

58
00:04:03,144 --> 00:04:08,498
When stock arrives again, enter the same product name and the

59
00:04:08,498 --> 00:04:10,057
new batch details.

60
00:04:10,057 --> 00:04:14,947
The portal keeps batches separate and updates the listing price.

61
00:04:14,947 --> 00:04:20,302
Expired stock is rejected or excluded, low-stock and near-expiry items are

62
00:04:20,302 --> 00:04:25,656
flagged, and demo orders allocate eligible stock by earliest expiry first.

63
00:04:25,656 --> 00:04:30,834
The supplier sits between a company and pharmacy shops.

64
00:04:30,834 --> 00:04:37,099
The supplier portal shows pharmacy replenishment requests, requested quantities, status updates,

65
00:04:37,099 --> 00:04:40,621
and sample listings for partner pharmacies.

66
00:04:40,621 --> 00:04:46,344
These are local workflow demonstrations, not purchase orders or shipments.

67
00:04:46,344 --> 00:04:52,507
The admin dashboard summarizes partner accounts, pending approvals, demo orders, and

68
00:04:52,507 --> 00:04:53,727
catalogue counts.

69
00:04:53,727 --> 00:04:59,890
An administrator can review and approve pending vendor or supplier profiles

70
00:04:59,890 --> 00:05:02,804
and inspect sample marketplace activity.

71
00:05:02,804 --> 00:05:06,816
Approval controls do not verify real licences.

72
00:05:06,816 --> 00:05:12,900
Healix is a presentation prototype, not a live pharmacy or sales

73
00:05:12,900 --> 00:05:13,524
service.

74
00:05:13,524 --> 00:05:19,608
Accounts, images, inventory, orders, and prices are local sample data; there

75
00:05:19,608 --> 00:05:25,692
is no shared backend, real authentication, payment, pharmacist verification, or fulfilment.

76
00:05:25,692 --> 00:05:30,720
Visit the public demo at healix-medical-app on GitHub Pages.
